Aplikacija Moj Petrol vam omogoča preprosto sporočanje stanja, pregled porabe in naročanje energentov ter spremljanje kartičnega in finančnega poslovanja. Člani Petrol kluba lahko na Petrolovih karticah pregledujete porabo in stanje točk, aplikacija pa omogoča naročanje elektrike, zemeljskega plina in utekočinjenega naftnega plina. Aplikacija uporabnikom nudi tudi odgovore na pogosto zastavljena vprašanja, v aplikaciji pa lahko Petrolu zastavite vprašanje ali najdete kontaktne podatke in obratovalni čas klicnega centra.

Z Moj Petrol aplikacijo lahko:
- uporabniki Petrol energentov Petrol elektrika in zemeljski plin sporočate stanje števca;
- analizirate porabo elektrike in zemeljskega plina skozi mesece in tako pravočasno odkrijete potratneže v svojem gospodinjstvu;
- naročate utekočinjen naftni plin (UNP);
- pregledujete porabo na Petrol kartici s podrobnostmi transakcij in prejetih računov. Račune lahko tudi preprosto prenesete ali pošljete dalje;
- pregledujte ugodnosti na Petrol klub kartici in stanje Zlatih točk;
- izvedete identifikacijo na prodajnih mestih Petrol s pomočjo shranjene črtne kode kartice zvestobe;
- omogočite oziroma spreminjajte načine obveščanja o Petrol akcijah in ugodnostih;
- pregledujete in urejate podatke svojega Moj Petrol računa;
- pošiljate vprašanja Petrolu oziroma stopite v stik s klicnim centrom

Če še nimate Moj Petrol računa, si ga lahko v nekaj preprostih korakih ustvarite v aplikaciji s pomočjo Petrol klub kartice zvestobe ali Petrol klub plačilne kartice zvestobe oz. slikate in vnesete podatke iz katerega koli vašega Petrol računa.

Purchasing Hungarian highway stickers, mobile parking, tickets and passes, and planning travels on BKK routes and lines and on local and commuting ones distributed by an offical retailer.
Ride a car, a bus or a tram free of complications. You can purchase your tickets cash and paper free in the whole territory of Hungary, without standing in queues. All you need is your mobile ‘phone, no matter if you drive a car or ride public transportation.


What is VoxPay app for?

Purchasing E-vignette highway sticker in minutes
- purchase it simply by using your mobile ‘phone, even if you are already traveling;
- different stickers (10 days, monthly, annual nationwide, annual county);
- buy many county stickers at the same time;
- buy stickers for several vehicles based on license plate numbers;
- keep track of validity, check them regularly, and receive notifications in e-mails before expiry, other warnings;
Simple, GPS based parking

No one likes fines and extra costs, so it is important for us to ensure more options for our customers to avoid these. Pay only as much as you park your vehicle.
  • low credit warning that notifies you of your low credit balance when parking your vehicle;
  • start-stop operation mode: you pay exactly as much as you park your vehicle;
  • automatic, GPS based zone localization;
  • option of paying without Internet connection;
  • warning before expiry and at the end of the parking time;
  • warning to stop parking time;
  • parking in public places and confined spaces nationwide;
  • looking for position of own vehicle parked;
  • records of favorite parking lots;

Fast and paper free public transportation
  • forget coins, ticket vending machines and paper based tickets;
  • buy your tickets valid in Budapest and for local and communting routes under a separate submenu, so that you will be able to find the right one for you immediately and pay for it;
  • public transportation mobile ticket and travel planning for BKK routes and lines: tickets, passes, and time based tickets that can be purchased quickly;
  • local and commuting service tickets in more than 80 cities;
  • 5% discount on tickets valid to long distance Volán bus shuttles;
  • purchasing, recording and checking the tickets is done on mobile telephones;
  • travel planning by voice assistance;
  • active Internet connection is required to use the mobile tickets (purchase/use)

Several payment methods, choose the one that is the easiest for you
  • registered bank card;
  • prepaid credit;
  • company and family fleet management by “the boss pays” function: handling cash register shared within the family by parental control, and common financing of company purchases option;

Parking and public transportation nationwide in the following cities:
Mobile parking in public places and public transportation in Budapest and in most of the cities: Balassagyarmat, Balatonföldvár, Balatonfüred, Békéscsaba, Cegléd, Csorna, Debrecen, Eger, Esztergom, Fonyód, Füzesgyarmat, Gyula, Gyöngyös, Győr, Gödöllő, Hajdúnánás, Hajdúszoboszló, Harkány, Hatvan, Hollókő, Hortobágy, Hévíz, Hódmezővásárhely, Kaposvár, Kapuvár, Kecskemét, Keszthely, Kiskunfélegyháza, Kőszeg, Mezőkövesd, Miskolc, Monor, Mosonmagyaróvár, Nagykanizsa, Nagymaros, Nyíregyháza, Orosháza, Pálháza, Pápa, Pécs, Ráckeve, Salgótarján, Siófok, Sopron, Szeged, Szekszárd, Szentendre, Szentes, Szentgotthárd, Szolnok, Szombathely, Székesfehérvár, Sárvár, Tamási, Tapolca, Tatabánya, Tihany, Veszprém, Zalaegerszeg

Aplikacija omogoča:
-	vpogled v splošne in tehnične podatke vašega merilnega mesta;
-	pregled števčnih stanj in porabe električne energije na vašem merilnem mestu;
-	oddajo števčnega stanja za merilna mesta na letnem obračunu;
-	prijavo na prejemanje obvestil o načrtovanih in nenačrtovanih prekinitvah distribucije električne energije: po e-pošti in /ali SMS. Mogoča je prijava na več e-naslovov in več GSM številk;
-	pregled izstavljenih računov in plačil ter vpogled v arhiv bremenitev in plačil, v primeru, da prejemate ločen račun za omrežnino in prispevke;
-	pošiljanje sporočila o okvari na omrežju.

Prijava je mogoča za vse uporabnike na oskrbnem območju Elektro Maribor. Aplikacija vsebuje tudi posebne storitve, ki so namenjene izključno uporabnikom, ki sodelujejo v projektu Premakni porabo. Tem uporabnikom je na razpolago pregled porabe za pretekli dan, izračun prihrankov ter arhiv obvestil o napovedi KKT (kritične konične tarife) in izravnave sistema.
